WEBVTT

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:07.980
<b>Alarm</b>

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:07.980
<b>Dismiss</b>

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:20.140
<i>I'm really not a morning person.</i>

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:22.830
<i>It seems like it takes 
me forever to wake up.</i>

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:24.680
<i>Today was different, though.</i>

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:26.300
Sophie-chan, good mo—

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:32.940
Oh, good morning, Akari.

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:34.990
What?!

00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:37.730
Sophie-chan, you changed your hairstyle?!

00:00:38.210 --> 00:00:40.450
<i>I was awake in an instant!</i>

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:15.480
<b>Episode 12</b>

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:15.480
<b>The Vampire and the Changing Seasons</b>

00:02:16.050 --> 00:02:18.240
You got a lot cut off!

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:20.830
I didn't know there were salons 
open in the middle of the night.

00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:22.990
You look great with short hair, too.

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:25.160
Oh, this happened

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:27.200
when I went to take out the trash earlier.

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:29.940
Since it's so close,
 I wasn't being very careful.

00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:31.430
So the sun hit it...

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:35.220
and most of it turned to ash.

00:02:37.810 --> 00:02:39.630
A-A-Ash?!

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:42.340
Well, these kinds of blunders 
happen from time to time.

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:44.330
I'm lucky it didn't hit my skin.

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:47.560
You can't put yourself in 
danger like that over trash!

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:49.350
It's a big deal, even if it's just your hair!

00:02:51.030 --> 00:02:54.890
But it's against the city's rules
to take the trash out at night.

00:02:54.890 --> 00:02:56.390
I'll do it!

00:02:56.390 --> 00:02:58.230
You're not allowed to take 
the trash out anymore!

00:02:58.540 --> 00:03:01.900
Well, by the time the sun goes down,
 it should be back to normal.

00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:05.360
I know, but...

00:03:05.360 --> 00:03:07.300
Hey, Sophie-chan...

00:03:07.740 --> 00:03:12.040
Let me play with it a bit 
before it grows back!

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:13.630
O-Okay...

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:18.570
You look kind of young 
with your hair like this.

00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:19.770
Really?

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:22.670
Look, we look the same!

00:03:22.670 --> 00:03:25.190
I can't tell since I don't have a reflection.

00:03:25.190 --> 00:03:28.860
Anyway, don't you have 
to get ready for school?

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:30.940
You're right!

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:37.600
I'm home!

00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:38.520
Welcome back.

00:03:39.220 --> 00:03:41.460
Your hair's already back!

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:44.540
You know, that length does suit you better.

00:03:44.540 --> 00:03:45.570
You think so?

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:49.750
All right, I'm going to get dinner ready.

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:53.420
<b>Delicious
Milk</b>

00:03:52.280 --> 00:03:53.410
Let's see...

00:03:56.440 --> 00:03:57.140
Oh?

00:03:57.740 --> 00:04:01.110
Sophie-chan, you don't have 
any blood left in the fridge.

00:04:01.110 --> 00:04:03.350
Oh, shoot.

00:04:03.350 --> 00:04:06.470
I meant to order some, but I forgot.

00:04:06.470 --> 00:04:09.230
Oh, well... Should be fine if 
I order with express delivery.

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:14.060
<b>Blood Delivery

00:04:14.280 --> 00:04:15.720
What's wrong?

00:04:15.720 --> 00:04:19.560
The site I usually order from 
is temporarily out of service.

00:04:19.560 --> 00:04:20.660
What?

00:04:21.020 --> 00:04:22.760
Good evening!

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:24.110
Thought I'd come over for a bit.

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:25.740
Hi, Ellie-chan.

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:28.220
And you can't find anything elsewhere?

00:04:28.220 --> 00:04:29.790
Doesn't look like it.

00:04:30.340 --> 00:04:32.770
What's up with you two?

00:04:32.770 --> 00:04:34.970
What's with these serious faces?

00:04:34.970 --> 00:04:35.800
Ellie?

00:04:36.650 --> 00:04:40.460
<i>Hey, that's it! Ellie probably 
has extra blood on hand.</i>

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:42.800
<i>She also uses it on her skin and in baths.</i>

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:45.380
<i>I should see if she'd let me have some.</i>

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:47.300
Ellie, I wanted to ask you...

00:04:46.610 --> 00:04:47.880
Oh, that reminds me.

00:04:47.880 --> 00:04:49.710
I've run out of blood.

00:04:49.710 --> 00:04:51.970
I was wondering if you could 
order me some online.

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:55.320
I see.

00:04:55.710 --> 00:04:57.600
I guess this is a bit of a problem.

00:04:58.510 --> 00:05:01.560
Ellie-chan, actually...

00:05:03.220 --> 00:05:04.520
Oh, my.

00:05:04.520 --> 00:05:07.470
So we won't be able to 
buy blood for a while.

00:05:07.470 --> 00:05:08.670
Right.

00:05:08.670 --> 00:05:11.260
What should we eat until then?

00:05:11.940 --> 00:05:14.490
My time has finally come!

00:05:15.100 --> 00:05:20.220
Go ahead and take as much of my 
blood from wherever you see fit!

00:05:20.220 --> 00:05:22.390
It's just a few days.

00:05:22.390 --> 00:05:23.400
We can tough it out.

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:25.560
What? Tough it out?

00:05:25.560 --> 00:05:27.420
Me, I said! Me!

00:05:27.700 --> 00:05:30.280
I've never been good at toughing it out.

00:05:30.280 --> 00:05:31.740
Hey!

00:05:31.740 --> 00:05:33.660
If we do it carefully so we 
don't cause a scene,

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:35.320
we could just suck someone's blood.

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:38.640
There are a lot of humans in the city,
 so there's bound to be

00:05:38.640 --> 00:05:42.480
some weirdos who'd like to have their 
blood sucked by a vampire once.

00:05:42.830 --> 00:05:44.000
There's one right here!

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:47.140
As long as they consent, it's not a problem.

00:05:47.140 --> 00:05:48.360
Hear, hear!

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:51.100
So I'll go out and see!

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:54.240
I'm too worried to let you go alone.

00:05:54.940 --> 00:05:58.160
You could just suck my blood...

00:05:59.990 --> 00:06:03.790
Does my blood really taste that bad?

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:18.750
There are a lot of really 
tasty-looking girls out here.

00:06:19.760 --> 00:06:20.940
What is it?

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:25.150
<b>Blood Bank</b>

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:23.080
A blood bank?

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:25.160
That sounds enticing.

00:06:25.160 --> 00:06:27.450
I wonder if they'd sell us some.

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:30.300
They won't. That blood is for transfusions.

00:06:30.300 --> 00:06:32.080
They don't have any for vampires.

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:34.470
I got some candy.

00:06:34.470 --> 00:06:36.210
That's kinda nice, huh?

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:37.830
For candy?

00:06:39.610 --> 00:06:41.300
I see how it is.

00:06:41.860 --> 00:06:43.440
Excuse me, miss.

00:06:43.780 --> 00:06:47.450
I've got much better sweets right here.

00:06:47.450 --> 00:06:48.460
What do you say?

00:06:48.460 --> 00:06:50.210
Want to donate some of your blood to me?

00:06:50.580 --> 00:06:53.270
Stop obstructing other people's businesses!

00:06:57.210 --> 00:06:59.890
I didn't get to suck anyone's blood.

00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:02.590
What's that cake for?

00:07:02.590 --> 00:07:05.600
I'm sucking Sophie's blood tonight.

00:07:06.210 --> 00:07:09.730
Wait, if vampires can suck 
each other's blood,

00:07:09.730 --> 00:07:12.650
doesn't that mean you have 
an unlimited food supply?

00:07:12.650 --> 00:07:17.520
No, we vampires suck something like the 
life force out of the blood we consume.

00:07:17.520 --> 00:07:21.320
So if you suck the blood from someone 
who's not alive, it's fairly meaningless.

00:07:21.690 --> 00:07:24.540
All it does is sate your hunger for a bit.

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:26.670
O-Oh, I see...

00:07:27.370 --> 00:07:28.130
Ow!

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:30.310
Stare...

00:07:30.310 --> 00:07:31.890
Stop staring like that.

00:07:31.890 --> 00:07:34.570
No! I wanna see it!

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:39.000
All right, I'm going to school.

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:39.950
Okay.

00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:51.940
I'm home.

00:07:51.940 --> 00:07:53.130
Welcome back.

00:07:53.130 --> 00:07:55.710
Oh? You're up early today.

00:07:55.710 --> 00:07:56.660
Yeah.

00:07:56.660 --> 00:08:00.880
Were you... so hungry you couldn't sleep?

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:02.810
That's not it.

00:08:03.390 --> 00:08:04.950
Don't worry about it.

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:06.680
Are you sure?

00:08:06.680 --> 00:08:08.380
How do you do?

00:08:09.870 --> 00:08:12.460
I was so hungry, I couldn't really sleep.

00:08:12.460 --> 00:08:14.140
I knew it!

00:08:14.140 --> 00:08:16.000
It's not that long! Just tough it out!

00:08:25.800 --> 00:08:27.430
Hey, Sophie.

00:08:27.430 --> 00:08:28.540
Yes?

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:32.330
Black hair that's cut short is so sexy.

00:08:32.890 --> 00:08:35.130
It really accentuates the 
whiteness of the neck.

00:08:36.250 --> 00:08:40.420
If you take a closer look,
Akari's quite a tasty-looking girl.

00:08:44.010 --> 00:08:47.960
It's not proper for a young woman 
to expose her neck like that.

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:50.030
A scarf? Is this for me?

00:08:50.030 --> 00:08:51.930
Why don't we kill some time with a movie?

00:08:51.930 --> 00:08:54.260
Sounds good! I like movies.

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:57.290
An action movie should distract us.

00:08:57.290 --> 00:08:58.220
You're right.

00:08:59.490 --> 00:09:00.660
<i>Freeze!</i>

00:09:00.660 --> 00:09:02.190
<i>This is the end of the line.</i>

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:04.810
<i>Slowly get on your knees 
and put your gun down.</i>

00:09:05.860 --> 00:09:07.640
<i>You're too late.</i>

00:09:07.640 --> 00:09:09.140
<i>The goods are already gone!</i>

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:17.150
I'm getting so hungry.

00:09:17.150 --> 00:09:21.240
Any movie with blood is torture. 
Let's stop this one.

00:09:21.800 --> 00:09:24.050
Let's just watch some peaceful 
slice-of-life anime.

00:09:24.760 --> 00:09:25.990
This should be fine.

00:09:25.990 --> 00:09:27.760
<i>Want to go somewhere on the way home?</i>

00:09:27.760 --> 00:09:28.910
<i>That sounds good.</i>

00:09:28.910 --> 00:09:32.750
<i>I know a great all-you-can-eat 
shabu-shabu place.</i>

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:35.610
<i>Nobody gets all-you-can-eat shabu shabu
 on the way home from school!</i>

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:35.510
<b>Rumble</b>

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:41.320
Young, healthy girls sure look tasty!

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:45.390
<b>The Next Day</b>

00:09:46.010 --> 00:09:48.920
<i>I hope Sophie and Ellie are okay.</i>

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:52.890
<i>They said the online shop 
should be reopened soon.</i>

00:09:52.890 --> 00:09:54.640
It's finally lunch time.

00:09:55.760 --> 00:09:59.150
I thought I was going to starve
 to death during class.

00:10:00.270 --> 00:10:04.310
Me, too. My stomach kept rumbling...

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:07.960
Starving... to death?!

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:09.490
What's wrong, Akari?!

00:10:09.490 --> 00:10:11.330
Are you sick?

00:10:12.240 --> 00:10:15.170
Sophie-chan, are you okay?
Are you still alive?!

00:10:15.820 --> 00:10:20.050
I'm a vampire, so I'm not alive, but I am okay.

00:10:21.740 --> 00:10:24.340
<i>She really doesn't seem very energetic.</i>

00:10:25.400 --> 00:10:26.860
Sophie-chan...

00:10:29.390 --> 00:10:31.710
Please drink my blood.

00:10:33.050 --> 00:10:36.740
My blood might not be particularly tasty,

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:39.860
but it must be better than nothing.

00:10:40.550 --> 00:10:44.210
Akari, you're worried about me?

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:51.360
I have no intention of accepting 
charity from you, though.

00:10:51.360 --> 00:10:52.080
Wha?!

00:10:53.160 --> 00:10:55.130
I'm so hungry.

00:10:55.890 --> 00:10:57.910
Ellie-chan, drink my...

00:10:57.910 --> 00:10:59.660
I don't want your blood.

00:11:02.310 --> 00:11:06.800
I'm sorry my blood is so disgusting 
that I can't help you at all,

00:11:06.800 --> 00:11:11.340
even when you're both suffering so much.

00:11:11.340 --> 00:11:12.860
Akari...

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:17.560
That's not it.

00:11:19.370 --> 00:11:22.460
The reason we don't want to suck your 
blood is because you're our friend.

00:11:22.460 --> 00:11:25.440
It would be dangerous to get 
into the habit of sucking

00:11:25.440 --> 00:11:28.310
blood from humans we're around every day.

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:31.330
Sophie-chan...

00:11:33.300 --> 00:11:38.600
<i>I get it. The reason you don't 
want to drink my blood is</i>

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:42.180
<i>because you care about me.</i>

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:46.520
<i>And yet, I was always 
obliviously trying to...</i>

00:11:46.520 --> 00:11:50.730
Well, I also just don't have any 
desire at all to drink her blood.

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:51.710
Same.

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:59.480
Besides, the site is going to be back 
up tonight, so it's not so bad.

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:01.650
Really?

00:12:02.330 --> 00:12:04.260
That's great.

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:09.170
Delivery!

00:12:14.090 --> 00:12:17.200
We can finally eat dinner together again.

00:12:17.200 --> 00:12:19.320
Everything's back to normal.

00:12:19.320 --> 00:12:21.290
I'm starving.

00:12:22.620 --> 00:12:23.510
Well, then...

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:25.720
Let's eat!

00:12:31.970 --> 00:12:33.620
It's so good!

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:34.820
It is.

00:12:36.040 --> 00:12:44.030
You know, I used to really 
want you two to suck my blood,

00:12:44.450 --> 00:12:47.900
but now I'm content with 
just fantasizing about it!

00:12:49.720 --> 00:12:50.860
I see.

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:55.460
<b>Fantasy in Full Swing</b>

00:12:56.360 --> 00:13:00.650
It's bad manners to fantasize and 
grin like that during a meal!

00:13:01.310 --> 00:13:03.120
She does look happy, though.

00:13:11.380 --> 00:13:13.590
What a nice night.

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:16.100
Maybe I should go for a walk.

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:30.440
So, where should I take a walk today?

00:13:31.510 --> 00:13:33.080
Oh, no!

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:35.450
I forgot to put shoes on!

00:13:35.450 --> 00:13:37.290
I need to go back and put some on.

00:13:41.660 --> 00:13:42.290
Oh?

00:13:42.900 --> 00:13:44.680
Are you going for a walk?

00:13:44.680 --> 00:13:45.580
Yeah.

00:13:45.580 --> 00:13:46.760
It's a nice night.

00:13:47.210 --> 00:13:49.420
I want to go, too!

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:50.890
That's fine, I guess.

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:52.180
Yay!

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:57.090
It's gotten pretty warm, huh?

00:13:57.090 --> 00:13:58.360
Yeah.

00:13:58.360 --> 00:14:01.100
I was thinking we could try 
to walk somewhere far today.

00:14:02.260 --> 00:14:04.810
Was there a specific place you had in mind?

00:14:04.810 --> 00:14:10.300
Well, there's this "date spot" 
in a park in the next town over.

00:14:10.300 --> 00:14:14.830
Maybe we'd look like a couple 
if we walked there together.

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:15.840
Vetoed.

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:19.570
A high school girl is too young for that.

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:21.590
<b>Nooooooo</b>

00:14:25.330 --> 00:14:26.950
Mori-san!

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:29.150
Oh, good evening!

00:14:29.150 --> 00:14:30.050
Good evening.

00:14:30.570 --> 00:14:32.090
Are you out jogging?

00:14:32.090 --> 00:14:33.630
I am!

00:14:34.030 --> 00:14:36.970
I took it up recently for my health.

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:42.850
I did gain some stamina, and people 
comment on how youthful I look!

00:14:44.260 --> 00:14:47.320
But you're already plenty young.

00:14:48.410 --> 00:14:50.650
Flattery gets you everywhere!

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:53.830
360s

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:53.830
50s

00:14:51.820 --> 00:14:53.830
Incidentally,
Teens

00:14:54.520 --> 00:14:59.030
Man, these computer things break so easily.

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:01.160
Huh?

00:15:01.160 --> 00:15:03.590
Hey, where are you two going?

00:15:04.010 --> 00:15:05.590
Oh, hi, Ellie-chan!

00:15:05.590 --> 00:15:06.870
We're just going on a walk.

00:15:06.870 --> 00:15:12.610
Aw, but I was just on my way to 
your house to ask you to fix this.

00:15:12.610 --> 00:15:16.090
You really need to stop hitting 
it in your attempts to "fix" it.

00:15:16.090 --> 00:15:18.080
How many have you broken now?

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:20.770
When are you getting back?

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:23.630
Akari's coming too, so it won't be that late.

00:15:23.630 --> 00:15:26.130
Then I'll just go in and wait for you.

00:15:26.130 --> 00:15:28.560
I wanted to finish that manga anyway.

00:15:28.560 --> 00:15:29.730
Later!

00:15:29.730 --> 00:15:30.790
Okay, later.

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:34.410
She's totally acting like she lives here.

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:37.260
Yes, but it's nice that 
she comes over so often.

00:15:38.100 --> 00:15:40.720
Yeah, you're right.

00:15:40.720 --> 00:15:42.960
Akari, aren't you tired?

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:44.600
We've been walking for a long time.

00:15:44.600 --> 00:15:46.160
I'm still fine!

00:15:49.160 --> 00:15:54.070
Schools have a totally different feel 
at night than during the day.

00:15:54.070 --> 00:15:55.230
Let's go inside.

00:15:55.230 --> 00:15:56.100
Huh?

00:16:06.510 --> 00:16:09.530
I've never been on the school's roof before!

00:16:12.040 --> 00:16:13.320
Wow!

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:16.520
You can see so much of the city!

00:16:16.520 --> 00:16:17.440
Akari?

00:16:17.440 --> 00:16:18.820
What is it, Sophie-chan?

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:23.670
You're saying you don't eat lunch 
on the roof like they do in anime?

00:16:25.870 --> 00:16:27.000
Hey!

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:27.000
<b>Rooftop
 Do Not Enter</b>

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:29.000
What are you doing out here this late?

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:32.140
Besides, the roof is <i>always</i> off limits!

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:33.970
<b>Rooftop
 Do Not Enter</b>

00:16:32.140 --> 00:16:33.970
It's written right here!

00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:35.980
Huh?

00:16:36.420 --> 00:16:38.480
What? Huh?

00:16:38.480 --> 00:16:40.880
But they were right there...

00:16:41.600 --> 00:16:45.420
<i>I hear a new ghost story started
going around school after that.</i>

00:16:48.870 --> 00:16:51.280
Watch where you step, Yuu.

00:16:51.280 --> 00:16:52.080
Yeah.

00:16:53.460 --> 00:16:58.560
There have been rumors about 
floating girls spotted in this area.

00:16:58.560 --> 00:17:02.170
A must-see for our occult club!

00:17:02.170 --> 00:17:04.170
Hey, could that be...

00:17:04.170 --> 00:17:04.930
Oh...

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:08.860
Sakuya, isn't that her over there?

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:15.810
I-I finally get to see the real...

00:17:16.250 --> 00:17:17.570
deal?

00:17:21.790 --> 00:17:24.720
Huh? Sakuya-chan? Yuu-chan?

00:17:24.720 --> 00:17:28.470
Akari-chan and... Sophie-chan?

00:17:28.470 --> 00:17:29.710
I knew it.

00:17:29.710 --> 00:17:31.930
What are you doing here?

00:17:31.930 --> 00:17:34.470
We're doing an investigation.

00:17:34.470 --> 00:17:37.200
We were looking for the floating girls.

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:40.280
There are rumors of that around here, too?

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:42.490
Let's get out of here, Akari.

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:45.910
S-See you later, Sophie-san.

00:17:51.520 --> 00:17:53.220
What is it, Mikan?

00:17:53.220 --> 00:17:54.520
Hinata-chan!

00:17:55.950 --> 00:17:57.830
Akari! Sophie!

00:17:57.830 --> 00:17:59.440
On a walk with Mikan-chan?

00:17:59.440 --> 00:18:00.130
Yeah.

00:18:03.460 --> 00:18:05.740
Hey, Mikan, stop that!

00:18:07.030 --> 00:18:09.860
I never thought I'd run into you here.

00:18:09.860 --> 00:18:11.210
Is this your usual walking route?

00:18:11.210 --> 00:18:13.520
We don't really have one.

00:18:13.880 --> 00:18:17.490
I was thinking we might run into you,
 though, if we came this way.

00:18:19.370 --> 00:18:20.650
Akari...

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:24.380
I... I'm so happy...

00:18:24.380 --> 00:18:25.920
Hinata-chan, what's wrong?

00:18:26.800 --> 00:18:28.880
Next time, you should
come to my place again.

00:18:28.880 --> 00:18:31.730
We can't always crash at Sophie's house.

00:18:31.730 --> 00:18:33.220
R-Right.

00:18:33.220 --> 00:18:35.640
Next time, we'll bring 
Ellie-chan with us, too.

00:18:38.520 --> 00:18:40.260
Don't worry, Sophie-chan.

00:18:40.880 --> 00:18:44.040
Once she understands that 
you want to be friends,

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:46.440
I'm sure she won't bark at you anymore.

00:18:48.630 --> 00:18:51.190
Be friends... Be friends...

00:19:02.450 --> 00:19:04.600
I guess she was so comfy, she fell asleep.

00:19:04.600 --> 00:19:06.410
Good for you, Sophie-chan!

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:07.480
Yeah.

00:19:07.480 --> 00:19:09.480
Want to try holding her?

00:19:09.480 --> 00:19:10.320
Yes.

00:19:12.930 --> 00:19:15.610
I-I guess it's still too soon for that.

00:19:15.610 --> 00:19:17.540
Sorry, Sophie.

00:19:18.870 --> 00:19:20.450
See you tomorrow, then.

00:19:20.450 --> 00:19:21.390
Yeah!

00:19:22.200 --> 00:19:24.600
We've run into so many people we know today.

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:26.270
Yeah.

00:19:26.270 --> 00:19:28.280
That reminds me, Sophie-chan...

00:19:28.280 --> 00:19:30.250
Want to walk over toward the woods?

00:19:30.810 --> 00:19:33.350
But there's nothing there.

00:19:33.350 --> 00:19:35.070
That's not true.

00:19:37.040 --> 00:19:39.020
Okay, then. I haven't been there in a while.

00:19:39.350 --> 00:19:41.760
I used to go there on my walks,

00:19:41.760 --> 00:19:44.150
but when weird rumors started 
going around, I stopped.

00:19:44.890 --> 00:19:48.490
But it was thanks to those rumors that 
I got to meet you in the first place.

00:19:49.290 --> 00:19:51.320
That takes me back.

00:19:51.320 --> 00:19:55.740
Thinking of the spot where I first met you...

00:20:02.380 --> 00:20:05.170
We're here. It's been a while.

00:20:05.170 --> 00:20:07.140
Y-Yeah.

00:20:08.020 --> 00:20:11.140
<i>I built this place up too much 
in my memory, didn't I?</i>

00:20:12.270 --> 00:20:14.600
The cherry trees are starting to bloom.

00:20:14.600 --> 00:20:17.330
Huh? Cherry trees? Where?

00:20:17.330 --> 00:20:20.060
It's so dark, I can't see anything.

00:20:20.060 --> 00:20:23.720
It was around this time 
of year when we met, too.

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:28.300
Hey, look! There's a rare mushroom there.

00:20:28.300 --> 00:20:29.620
Huh? Wai—

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:31.060
Sophie-chan...

00:20:36.720 --> 00:20:38.540
Sophie-chan...

00:20:45.020 --> 00:20:47.490
Sophie-chan, where are you?

00:20:47.490 --> 00:20:49.870
Hey, Sophie-chan!

00:20:49.870 --> 00:20:52.170
What is Akari doing?

00:20:53.120 --> 00:20:59.150
Oh, right, humans can't see 
anything in the dark.

00:20:59.790 --> 00:21:01.900
I totally forgot.

00:21:11.310 --> 00:21:12.350
Akari!

00:21:12.350 --> 00:21:13.860
Sophie-chan!

00:21:14.830 --> 00:21:16.590
Thank goodness.

00:21:16.590 --> 00:21:19.510
All of a sudden, you were just gone.

00:21:20.090 --> 00:21:25.490
But I knew you would come and find me.

00:21:27.310 --> 00:21:29.990
Wait, isn't this...

00:21:35.860 --> 00:21:37.480
Don't be afraid.

00:21:38.260 --> 00:21:41.120
I'm just your run-of-the-mill 
vampire passing by.

00:21:41.120 --> 00:21:42.940
Nobody suspicious.

00:21:44.180 --> 00:21:49.120
Um, I lost my way.

00:21:49.680 --> 00:21:51.780
My name is Amano Akari.

00:21:51.780 --> 00:21:55.360
There's this place called "The Doll Mansion."
 I was looking for it.

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:58.340
That's my house.

00:21:58.770 --> 00:22:00.210
You can come over.

00:22:00.210 --> 00:22:02.420
Akari, here.

00:22:07.010 --> 00:22:08.020
<i>That's right.</i>

00:22:10.630 --> 00:22:13.280
<i>This is where I met Sophie-chan,</i>

00:22:13.280 --> 00:22:17.710
<i>and this is where my new life 
with Sophie-chan began.</i>

00:22:54.280 --> 00:22:56.180
Now it's not scary anymore, right?

00:22:56.610 --> 00:22:57.550
Right!

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:01.430
It's late.

00:23:01.430 --> 00:23:03.390
Let's fly back home.

00:23:04.080 --> 00:23:05.020
Wait!

00:23:10.080 --> 00:23:13.570
Can we keep walking a little longer?

00:23:16.020 --> 00:23:17.870
I guess that's fine.

00:23:17.870 --> 00:23:21.580
Together... Slowly. Okay?

00:23:22.170 --> 00:23:23.350
Got it.

00:23:25.400 --> 00:23:29.150
I want to keep walking with 
you for hours and hours.

00:23:29.150 --> 00:23:32.600
You have school tomorrow.
We're going to get home at a decent hour.

00:23:32.600 --> 00:23:35.430
Just a little bit longer!
